OL,3,AThree children and teacher killed by
OL,4,A16-year-old at Oregon primary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old shot dead three children
OL,7,Fand a teacher at a primary school in
OL,8,Fthe US state of Oregon before he was
OL,9,Fkilled by a bystander, according to
OL,10,Fpolice.
OL,12,FThe suspect, who has not been named,
OL,13,Fforced his way into Silver Rail
OL,14,FElementary School in the city of Bend
OL,15,Fon Thursday afternoon by shooting at
OL,16,Flocked doors, police said.
OL,18,FBend Police Chief Mike Krantz said the
OL,19,Fteenager was shot dead by a community
OL,20,Fmember who "pursued him into the school
OL,21,Fand engaged him".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
